      "text": "Planning and Overview share appointments, medications and the events the patient confirmed through ObservePlanning.\nEvents are optional: if they can't be read, appointments and medications still show.\nAppointment rows and the next-appointment card open AppointmentDetailScreen, event rows in Planning open EventDetailScreen; Back returns to the origin.",
